1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,380
X tool, metal fab, laser welder, 800 watts, unboxing and first use.
xTool MetalFab 激光焊机 800 瓦，开箱与首次使用。

2
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:08,180
Take out all the items.
取出所有物品。

3
00:00:08,180 --> 00:01:47,970
Open the lid first.
先打开顶盖。

4
00:01:47,970 --> 00:01:49,810
Place the main unit.
放置主机。

5
00:01:49,810 --> 00:01:55,840
Leave a gap of more than 10 centimeters at the front and back of the main unit.
主机前后要留出 10 厘米以上的间隙。

6
00:01:55,840 --> 00:02:01,290
Lock the four caster wheels.
锁住四个脚轮。

7
00:02:01,290 --> 00:02:11,410
Connect the shielding gas cylinder.
连接保护气气瓶。

8
00:02:11,410 --> 00:02:16,610
Insert one end of the tube into the shielding gas inlet on the main unit.
把气管的一端插入主机上的保护气进气口。

9
00:02:16,610 --> 00:02:20,950
Connect the other end of the tube to the cylinder or gas generator.
把气管的另一端连接到气瓶或气体发生器上。

10
00:02:20,950 --> 00:02:28,150
Place the welding head.
放置焊接头。

11
00:02:28,150 --> 00:02:49,520
Assemble the welding head cradle.
组装焊接头托架。

12
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,640
Place the welding head on the cradle.
把焊接头放在托架上。

13
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:59,220
Connect the workpiece sensing cable.
连接工件感应线。

14
00:02:59,220 --> 00:03:03,660
Insert the connector end into the port for the workpiece sensing cable.
把接头一端插入工件感应线的接口。

15
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:08,540
Connect to a power supply.
连接电源。

16
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:14,740
This product requires a 220 to 240 volt AC power supply and works at a rated power of
本产品需要 220 至 240 伏交流电源，额定功率为

17
00:03:14,740 --> 00:03:19,460
three kilowatts and a full load current of 13.5 amps.
3 千瓦，满载电流为 13.5 安培。

18
00:03:19,460 --> 00:03:25,300
An individual branch circuit with a current carrying capacity of 20 amps or above is recommended.
建议使用载流能力在 20 安培及以上的独立分支电路。

19
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:28,380
Ensure that the power supply is grounded.
确保电源已接地。

20
00:03:28,380 --> 00:03:31,620
The connection of power cables varies with their standards.
电源线的接法因其标准不同而有所差异。

21
00:03:31,620 --> 00:03:39,290
If hard wiring operation is required, it should be performed by a professional electrician.
如果需要硬接线操作，应由专业电工来完成。

22
00:03:39,290 --> 00:03:50,500
Insert the connector with a push button to the power port of the main unit.
把带按钮的接头插入主机的电源接口。

23
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:55,330
Check the emergency stop button.
检查急停按钮。

24
00:03:55,330 --> 00:03:59,290
Ensure that the emergency stop button is released.
确保急停按钮处于松开状态。

25
00:03:59,290 --> 00:04:03,270
Insert the key.
插入钥匙。

26
00:04:03,270 --> 00:04:08,210
Insert the key into its designated port.
把钥匙插入指定的钥匙孔。

27
00:04:08,210 --> 00:04:11,170
Power on and unlock the device.
开机并解锁设备。

28
00:04:11,170 --> 00:04:21,110
On the back panel of the main unit, turn on the power switch to activate the device.
在主机后面板上，打开电源开关以启动设备。

29
00:04:21,110 --> 00:04:24,710
On the touch screen, select a language and unit.
在触摸屏上选择语言和单位。

30
00:04:24,710 --> 00:04:29,110
The first time you turn on the device, you will see a QR code on the touch screen.
第一次开机时，你会在触摸屏上看到一个二维码。

31
00:04:29,110 --> 00:04:34,320
Scan the QR code to watch the safety training videos.
扫描二维码观看安全培训视频。

32
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:39,320
After watching the video, input the serial number shown on the touch screen to the web.
看完视频后，把触摸屏上显示的序列号输入到网页中。

33
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:44,760
To generate an unlock password for your device, on the touch screen of your device, tap enter
为你的设备生成解锁密码，然后在设备的触摸屏上，点击“输入

34
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,200
the password.
密码”。

35
00:04:46,200 --> 00:04:51,000
Enter the password generated to unlock your device.
输入生成的密码来解锁设备。

36
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,900
Calibrate the focus for the welding head.
校准焊接头的焦点。

37
00:04:52,900 --> 00:04:57,300
On the home page of the touch screen, tap system settings and check the value of focus
在触摸屏主页上，点击“系统设置”，查看焦点

38
00:04:57,300 --> 00:05:01,630
scale reference.
刻度参考值。

39
00:05:01,630 --> 00:05:04,490
Check if the graduated tube is of the same value.
检查刻度管是否为相同的数值。

40
00:05:04,490 --> 00:05:06,930
If yes, no calibration is needed.
如果是，就不需要校准。

41
00:05:06,930 --> 00:05:09,670
If not, adjust the graduated tube.
如果不是，就调整刻度管。

42
00:05:09,670 --> 00:05:10,930
Open the fastener.
打开卡扣。

43
00:05:10,930 --> 00:05:17,290
Push or pull the graduated tube to adjust it to the reference value.
推动或拉动刻度管，把它调到参考值。

44
00:05:17,290 --> 00:05:18,770
Install the drive rolls.
安装送丝轮。

45
00:05:18,770 --> 00:05:26,770
This video exemplifies installing 1mm welding wire on the 1mm guiding rail.
本视频以在 1mm 导轨上安装 1mm 焊丝为例。

46
00:05:26,770 --> 00:05:32,750
Open the door.
打开舱门。

47
00:05:32,750 --> 00:05:36,740
Open the wire feeding driver.
打开送丝驱动器。

48
00:05:36,740 --> 00:05:43,390
Remove the screws.
拆下螺丝。

49
00:05:43,390 --> 00:05:48,810
Install the drive rolls.
安装送丝轮。

50
00:05:48,810 --> 00:05:53,120
Install the screws back.
把螺丝装回去。

51
00:05:53,120 --> 00:06:02,510
Install the other pair of drive rolls above the wire feeding driver.
把另一对送丝轮安装在送丝驱动器上方。

52
00:06:02,510 --> 00:06:04,910
Install the wire feeding tube.
安装送丝管。

53
00:06:04,910 --> 00:06:07,710
Close the right tensioner.
合上右侧的压紧器。

54
00:06:07,710 --> 00:06:10,910
Loosen the screw on the right side of the wire feeding driver.
松开送丝驱动器右侧的螺丝。

55
00:06:10,910 --> 00:06:16,390
Insert the end of the wire feeding tube without a fastener to the wire feeder.
把送丝管没有卡扣的一端插入送丝机。

56
00:06:16,390 --> 00:06:20,710
Lead the nozzle in until its stem presses against the right panel of the wire feeding
把喷嘴滑进去，直到它的杆部抵住送丝

57
00:06:20,710 --> 00:06:21,710
driver.
驱动器的右侧面板。

58
00:06:21,710 --> 00:06:23,190
Tighten the screw to fix the nozzle.
拧紧螺丝以固定喷嘴。

59
00:06:23,190 --> 00:06:25,030
Open the right tensioner.
打开右侧的压紧器。

60
00:06:25,030 --> 00:06:29,360
Load the welding wire.
装上焊丝。

61
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:34,800
Unscrew the cap of the wire turntable.
拧下焊丝转盘的盖子。

62
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:44,360
Tighten the hole with the pin.
把孔对准销钉。

63
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:48,000
Ensure that the wire spool is installed in the correct direction.
确保焊丝盘的安装方向正确。

64
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:52,240
After released, the wire comes out from the bottom of the wire spool to enter the wire
放线后，焊丝从焊丝盘的底部出来，进入送丝

65
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:55,420
feeding driver.
驱动器。

66
00:06:55,420 --> 00:06:56,820
Take out the wire end.
取出焊丝末端。

67
00:06:56,820 --> 00:07:02,400
Do not release the wire or it will unravel.
不要松开焊丝，否则它会散开。

68
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:06,360
Cut off the bent end of the wire.
剪掉焊丝弯曲的末端。

69
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:11,580
Thread the wire into the wire feeding driver.
把焊丝穿入送丝驱动器。

70
00:07:11,580 --> 00:07:14,260
Press the wire slightly to make it pass through.
轻轻按压焊丝，让它穿过去。

71
00:07:14,260 --> 00:07:19,820
Ensure that the wire passes through the drive rolls into the wire feeding tube.
确保焊丝穿过送丝轮进入送丝管。

72
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:24,590
Close the tensioners.
合上压紧器。

73
00:07:24,590 --> 00:07:34,350
Rotate the tensioner's knobs to adjust the wire feed tension.
转动压紧器的旋钮来调节送丝张力。

74
00:07:34,350 --> 00:07:36,310
Feed the welding wire.
送出焊丝。

75
00:07:36,310 --> 00:07:42,630
When delivered, the wire feeding tube is installed with a 0.8 slash 1.0 nozzle at the end with
出厂时，送丝管带卡扣的一端已经装好了 0.8/1.0 的喷嘴，

76
00:07:42,630 --> 00:07:44,270
a fastener.
就在这一端。

77
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:48,990
On the touch screen, tap wire feed control, then press and hold the feed button.
在触摸屏上点击“送丝控制”，然后按住送丝按钮。

78
00:07:48,990 --> 00:07:52,670
Wire spool rotates counterclockwise at a constant speed.
焊丝盘以恒定速度逆时针转动。

79
00:07:52,670 --> 00:07:56,030
When the wire extends from the nozzle, stop wire feeding.
当焊丝从喷嘴伸出来时，停止送丝。

80
00:07:56,110 --> 00:08:01,850
If the wire extends too far, press the retract button to return the wire.
如果焊丝伸出太多，按回抽按钮把焊丝退回去。

81
00:08:01,850 --> 00:08:05,040
Close the door.
关上舱门。

82
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:08,520
Install the wire feeding tube on the welding head.
把送丝管安装到焊接头上。

83
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:09,960
Open the fastener.
打开卡扣。

84
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,920
Slide it onto the welding head tip.
把它滑到焊接头的端部。

85
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:16,220
Ensure that the wire comes out from the groove of the welding nozzle.
确保焊丝从焊接喷嘴的槽中出来。

86
00:08:16,220 --> 00:08:21,930
Close the fastener.
扣上卡扣。

87
00:08:21,930 --> 00:08:27,100
Fine tune the wire.
微调焊丝。

88
00:08:27,100 --> 00:08:30,510
Secure the wire feeding tube.
固定好送丝管。

89
00:08:30,510 --> 00:08:33,150
Place back on the welding head cradle.
放回焊接头托架上。

90
00:08:33,150 --> 00:08:37,230
Use X-Tool metal fab laser welder 800 watts.
使用 xTool MetalFab 激光焊机 800 瓦。

91
00:08:37,230 --> 00:08:42,350
Before operating the device, please follow the safety instructions to put on PPE and
在操作设备之前，请按照安全说明穿戴个人防护装备，并

92
00:08:42,350 --> 00:08:44,590
take proper safety precautions.
采取适当的安全防范措施。

93
00:08:44,590 --> 00:08:51,630
Necessary PPE includes laser safety goggles, welding helmets, dust mask, laser and heat-resistant
必要的个人防护装备包括激光防护眼镜、焊接面罩、防尘口罩、防激光和耐热的

94
00:08:51,630 --> 00:08:54,310
gloves, clothing and aprons.
手套、服装以及围裙。

95
00:08:54,310 --> 00:08:58,260
Ensure that the workroom is well ventilated.
确保工作间通风良好。

96
00:08:58,260 --> 00:09:00,900
Laser welding in standard mode.
标准模式下的激光焊接。

97
00:09:00,900 --> 00:09:06,940
Ensure that a gas flow meter is fitted to the gas cylinder or gas generator.
确保气瓶或气体发生器上装有气体流量计。

98
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:10,890
Ensure that enable lasering is off.
确保“启用激光”处于关闭状态。

99
00:09:10,890 --> 00:09:14,640
Open the gas cylinder valve.
打开气瓶阀门。

100
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:18,600
Press and hold the grip sensing button and trigger to allow gas flow.
按住握持感应按钮和扳机，让气体流出。

101
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:25,720
Meanwhile, adjust the gas flow rate to 15 to 30 liters per minute.
同时，把气体流量调到每分钟 15 到 30 升。

102
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:28,840
Place the workpiece on a metal base.
把工件放在金属底座上。

103
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:32,920
Clamp the workpiece sensing cable to the workpiece or to a conductive object connected
把工件感应线夹在工件上，或者夹在与工件相连的

104
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:33,920
with the workpiece.
导电物体上。

105
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:39,240
It is strictly prohibited to attach the clamp to the graduated tube of the welding head.
严禁把夹子夹在焊接头的刻度管上。

106
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:43,160
Adjust the feed and retract buttons on the welding head to adjust the wire until its
按焊接头上的送丝和回抽按钮调整焊丝，直到它的

107
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:46,040
tip coincides with the red spot.
末端与红点重合。

108
00:09:46,040 --> 00:09:49,760
Calibrate the welding head if the red spot falls at the left or right side of the extended
如果红点落在伸出焊丝的左侧或右侧，

109
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:53,440
wire or if the spot is not visible or blurred.
或者红点看不见或模糊，就需要校准焊接头。

110
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:57,800
Refer to the calibrate the red spot position part in maintenance.
请参阅维护部分中的“校准红点位置”。

111
00:09:57,800 --> 00:10:02,560
Turn on the wire feeding enable switch to enable the auto feeding function.
打开送丝使能开关，启用自动送丝功能。

112
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:06,240
On the touch screen, choose standard mode, weld.
在触摸屏上选择标准模式，焊接。

113
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:10,200
Select the material type, material thickness, and wire diameter.
选择材料类型、材料厚度和焊丝直径。

114
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:13,400
Tap enable wire feeding to allow wire feeding.
点击“启用送丝”以允许送丝。

115
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:16,560
And tap enable lasering to allow laser emission.
再点击“启用激光”以允许激光出光。

116
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:17,920
Align the parts to be welded.
把待焊接的零件对齐。

117
00:10:17,920 --> 00:10:22,360
Aiming the welding nozzle at the starting point, press and hold the grip sensing button
把焊接喷嘴对准起点，按住握持感应按钮

118
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:25,280
and trigger to start welding.
和扳机开始焊接。

119
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:29,360
Tack weld the starting and ending points first, then start seam welding.
先点焊起点和终点，然后开始焊缝焊接。

120
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:33,880
As the welding head feeds the wire forward, a reaction force is generated from the welding
焊接头向前送丝时，焊接点会产生一个反作用力，

121
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:37,080
point that pushes the welding head backward.
把焊接头往后推。

122
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:40,520
Simply hold the welding head steady and guide the direction.
只需稳稳握住焊接头并引导方向即可。

123
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:44,320
To avoid wire sticking, do not press the welding head downward.
为避免粘丝，不要往下压焊接头。

124
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:48,560
After the welding is completed, the work piece and parts of the welding head will remain
焊接完成后，工件和焊接头的部分部位仍然会很

125
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:49,560
hot.
烫。

126
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:52,360
Do not touch the hot areas without protection.
没有防护时不要触摸高温区域。

127
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:56,120
Turn off enable wire feeding and enable lasering.
关闭“启用送丝”和“启用激光”。

128
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:58,400
Laser cleaning.
激光清洗。

129
00:10:58,400 --> 00:11:00,440
Turn off the device.
关闭设备。

130
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:05,110
Remove the wire feeding tube.
取下送丝管。

131
00:11:05,110 --> 00:11:07,310
Remove the welding nozzle.
取下焊接喷嘴。

132
00:11:07,310 --> 00:11:11,020
Replace with the cleaning nozzle.
换上清洗喷嘴。

133
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:13,260
Turn on the device.
打开设备。

134
00:11:13,260 --> 00:11:14,340
Tap clean.
点击“清洗”。

135
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:15,980
Tap enable lasering.
点击“启用激光”。

136
00:11:15,980 --> 00:11:16,980
Tap confirm.
点击“确认”。

137
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:19,860
Aim the cleaning nozzle at the starting point.
把清洗喷嘴对准起点。

138
00:11:19,860 --> 00:11:24,020
Press and hold the grip sensing button and trigger to start cleaning.
按住握持感应按钮和扳机开始清洗。

139
00:11:24,020 --> 00:11:33,200
Ensure that the welding head moves in the same direction as the welding seam.
确保焊接头沿着焊缝的方向移动。

140
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:35,720
Laser cleaning is completed.
激光清洗完成。

141
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:37,800
Laser cutting.
激光切割。

142
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:42,960
On the touch screen, tap system settings and take down the value of focus scale reference.
在触摸屏上点击“系统设置”，记下焦点刻度参考值。

143
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:45,080
Turn off the device.
关闭设备。

144
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:50,530
Open the fastener to remove the current tip.
打开卡扣，取下当前的喷嘴头。

145
00:11:50,530 --> 00:11:54,000
Insert the cutting tip.
插入切割头。

146
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:57,000
Keep consistent with focus scale reference.
与焦点刻度参考值保持一致。

147
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,840
Close the fastener.
扣上卡扣。

148
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:03,280
Replace the gas flow meter on the cylinder with a gas pressure reducing valve.
把气瓶上的气体流量计换成减压阀。

149
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:08,320
Turn on the device and check if the welding head emits a clear and integral red spot.
打开设备，检查焊接头是否发出清晰完整的红点。

150
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:13,640
If not, calibrate the red spot position to avoid burning the nozzle during laser cutting.
如果没有，就校准红点位置，以免激光切割时烧坏喷嘴。

151
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:21,800
Adjust the air pressure to 0.6 to 0.8 megapascals.
把气压调到 0.6 到 0.8 兆帕。

152
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:22,800
Tap cut.
点击“切割”。

153
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:25,640
Select the material type and material thickness.
选择材料类型和材料厚度。

154
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:27,200
Tap enable lasering.
点击“启用激光”。

155
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:28,480
Tap confirm.
点击“确认”。

156
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:33,000
Start laser cutting.
开始激光切割。

157
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:35,140
Laser cutting is completed.
激光切割完成。

158
00:12:35,140 --> 00:12:37,080
Replace the wire feeding nozzle.
更换送丝喷嘴。

159
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:41,240
The wire feeding tube has an end with a fastener and a replaceable nozzle.
送丝管有一端带卡扣和可更换的喷嘴。

160
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:51,890
You need to replace the nozzle based on the diameter of the welding wire.
你需要根据焊丝直径来更换喷嘴。

161
00:12:51,890 --> 00:12:54,290
Clean or replace the lens protector.
清洁或更换保护镜片。

162
00:12:54,290 --> 00:12:58,930
If the laser power decreases and the welding spark weakens, the welding head's lens protector
如果激光功率下降、焊接火花变弱，焊接头的保护镜片

163
00:12:58,930 --> 00:13:01,370
may get dirty or damaged.
可能脏了或损坏了。

164
00:13:01,370 --> 00:13:04,090
Clean or replace it as needed.
根据需要清洁或更换它。

165
00:13:04,090 --> 00:13:09,290
Please clean or replace the lens protector in a dust-free or relatively clean environment.
请在无尘或相对洁净的环境中清洁或更换保护镜片。

166
00:13:09,290 --> 00:13:14,890
Before operations, clean the welding head with lint-free paper or lint-free cloth and wash
操作前，先用无尘纸或无尘布清洁焊接头，并洗

167
00:13:14,890 --> 00:13:17,490
your hands or wear lint-free gloves.
手或戴上无尘手套。

168
00:13:17,490 --> 00:13:20,930
Remove the cover on the top of the welding head.
取下焊接头顶部的盖子。

169
00:13:20,930 --> 00:13:25,980
Take out the lens protector closest to the nozzle.
取出离喷嘴最近的那片保护镜片。

170
00:13:25,980 --> 00:13:27,680
Check the lens protector.
检查保护镜片。

171
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:32,380
If the lens protector is dirty, use a cotton swab dipped with alcohol to clean it.
如果保护镜片脏了，用蘸了酒精的棉签清洁它。

172
00:13:32,380 --> 00:13:34,460
Then install it back to the welding head.
然后把它装回焊接头。

173
00:13:34,460 --> 00:13:39,860
If the lens protector is burned or heavily dirty and uncleanable, it needs to be replaced.
如果保护镜片被烧坏或严重脏污、无法清洁，就需要更换。

174
00:13:39,860 --> 00:13:49,520
Keep your hands clean or wear lint-free gloves to remove the gasket and lens protector.
保持双手清洁或戴上无尘手套，取下密封垫和保护镜片。

175
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:52,950
Take out a new lens protector.
取出一片新的保护镜片。

176
00:13:52,950 --> 00:13:58,350
Do not touch the glass with your fingers or other tools during replacement to prevent dirt.
更换时不要用手指或其他工具碰触镜片玻璃，以免弄脏。

177
00:13:58,350 --> 00:14:04,110
If the glass accidentally gets dirty or dusty, use a cotton swab to clean it.
如果镜片不小心沾上了污物或灰尘，用棉签清洁它。

178
00:14:04,110 --> 00:14:09,260
Remove the protective film on the top.
撕掉顶部的保护膜。

179
00:14:09,260 --> 00:14:12,060
Install the lens protector.
装上保护镜片。

180
00:14:12,060 --> 00:14:14,660
Remove the protective film on the other side.
撕掉另一面的保护膜。

181
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:25,580
Install the gasket back.
把密封垫装回去。

182
00:14:25,580 --> 00:14:28,460
Install the lens protector back to the welding head.
把保护镜片装回焊接头。

183
00:14:28,460 --> 00:14:35,410
Install the lens protector in the correct direction and press it into place.
按正确的方向安装保护镜片，并把它按压到位。

184
00:14:35,410 --> 00:14:39,730
Calibrate the red spot position for the welding head.
校准焊接头的红点位置。

185
00:14:39,730 --> 00:14:41,930
Calibrate the left or right offset.
校准左右偏移。

186
00:14:41,930 --> 00:14:46,450
If you use the pre-installed welding nozzle for laser welding, perform a left or right
如果你使用预装的焊接喷嘴进行激光焊接，当喷嘴安装正确、

187
00:14:46,450 --> 00:14:52,250
offset calibration when the laser spot deviates left or right from the wire, despite proper
激光光斑却向焊丝左侧或右侧偏离时，就要进行左右

188
00:14:52,250 --> 00:14:54,130
nozzle installation.
偏移校准。

189
00:14:54,130 --> 00:14:59,730
On the touch screen of the main unit, tap system settings, machine settings, enter administrator
在主机触摸屏上，点击“系统设置”、“机器设置”，进入“管理员

190
00:14:59,730 --> 00:15:01,810
settings.
设置”。

191
00:15:01,810 --> 00:15:10,040
Then input the 8-digit password, 8888888.
然后输入 8 位密码 8888888。

192
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:13,520
To the right of red spot position offset, tap start.
在“红点位置偏移”右侧，点击“开始”。

193
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:18,000
Then tap the left arrow to decrease the offset and move the red spot leftward.
然后点击左箭头减小偏移量，使红点向左移动。

194
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:22,520
Tap the right arrow to increase the offset and move the red spot rightward.
点击右箭头增大偏移量，使红点向右移动。

195
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:26,960
When the center of the red spot falls at the welding wire, tap completed.
当红点的中心落在焊丝上时，点击“完成”。

196
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:28,960
Calibrate the up or down offset.
校准上下偏移。

197
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:33,760
When a cutting nozzle is used, the laser beam may strike the nozzle's inner wall, resulting
使用切割喷嘴时，激光束可能会打到喷嘴内壁上，导致

198
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:36,760
in either blockage or reflection.
遮挡或反射。

199
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:43,540
In such cases, perform left or right offset calibration.
在这种情况下，进行左右偏移校准。

200
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:48,820
If the problem persists, reset the red spot position offset to zero, and try calibrating
如果问题仍然存在，把红点位置偏移重置为零，再尝试校准

201
00:15:48,820 --> 00:15:53,000
the up or down offset.
上下偏移。

202
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:57,720
Insert the hex key into hole one or hole two, and slowly turn the screw while observing
把内六角扳手插入 1 号孔或 2 号孔，一边慢慢转动螺丝，一边观察

203
00:15:57,720 --> 00:16:08,160
the light emitting from the nozzle.
喷嘴射出的光。

204
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:15,430
If a clear red spot appears, stop turning the screw.
如果出现清晰的红点，就停止转动螺丝。

205
00:16:15,430 --> 00:16:18,310
Replace the welding wire.
更换焊丝。

206
00:16:18,310 --> 00:16:23,470
Now we replace the one millimeter welding wire with a 1.2 millimeter welding wire.
现在我们把 1 毫米焊丝换成 1.2 毫米焊丝。

207
00:16:23,470 --> 00:16:25,630
Open the door of the main unit.
打开主机的舱门。

208
00:16:25,630 --> 00:16:30,260
Rotate the wire spool clockwise to retract the wire.
顺时针转动焊丝盘，把焊丝退回来。

209
00:16:30,260 --> 00:16:36,160
Tuck the wire end in the hole of the wire spool.
把焊丝末端塞进焊丝盘的孔里。

210
00:16:36,160 --> 00:16:43,170
Unscrew the cap and take out the wire spool.
拧下盖子，取出焊丝盘。

211
00:16:43,170 --> 00:16:53,410
Install the new 1.2 millimeter wire spool.
装上新的 1.2 毫米焊丝盘。

212
00:16:53,410 --> 00:16:57,250
Install the cap back.
把盖子装回去。

213
00:16:57,250 --> 00:17:00,250
Feed the wire and adjust feed tension as illustrated before.
按照前面演示的方法送丝并调节送丝张力。
